d":"9da6d2ad1c02d5ceff7608434e0e4545","externalId":"bd02294770af9706e1d555d440b1bd94","name":"[dev] S01 Hospital walk: add-form default, list badge, three states by hand, pre-selection per state, override, reload","fullName":"TC-06 Admission Status Toggle › TC-06/S01"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-06 Admission Status Toggle · <b>S01</b> 「医院走一遍：添加表单默认值、列表徽章、手动选三个状态、每个状态的预选、手动改模板、重新加载」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Hospital walk: add-form default, list badge, three states by hand, pre-selection per state, override, reload</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Nothing is ever New Admission (or Consult) unless the physician set it: the app never guesses the status, and a patient nobody has set reads Follow-up（UAT TC-06）</li><li><b>U3</b> The manual add form has the three-state toggle (New Admission / Follow-up / Consult) at creation, it defaults to Follow-up, and the state chosen there (or left untouched) is the one saved（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 2；TFA-92584 AC 3）</li><li><b>U4</b> The physician can change the badge by hand at any time (before or after Generate, and on a patient whose status already rolled) through all three states, and each change persists (list, chart, reload …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 1）</li><li><b>U8</b> The badge pre-selects the template at Generate: Hospital New Admission -&gt; H&amp;P, Follow-up -&gt; SOAP progress, Consult -&gt; Consult note; …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6；TFA-92584 AC 7）</li><li><b>U9</b> The physician still sees the template picker at Generate and can change the pre-selected template by hand; changing the template does not change the badge, and Generate writes the note in the templat …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6）</li><li><b>U12</b> All of the above works in both Hospital and Nursing Home (step 7, ground rule 3.3)（UAT TC-06；UAT 3.3；TFA-92584 AC 7）</li><li><b>T2</b> Discharge templates (Discharge summary; SNF discharge once it exists) are never pre-selected by the badge in either context; they are only chosen by hand (UAT TC-06 step 6)（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6；TFA-92599 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>主流程（happy-path） — 照 UAT / 票的原话把正常流程走一遍，该出现的都要出现。</p><p><b>Given </b>Fresh @roundai.test physician with the session fixture: one Hospital patient nobody has set a status for</p><p><b>When </b>Look at the untouched Add Patient form; open the patient's chart; on the Encounter tab set the badge to New Admission, then Consult; with Consult set, change Note Format by hand to SOAP progress; reload; go back to the list</p><p><b>Then </b>Add form offers all three states with Follow-up selected; the untouched patient is Follow-up with SOAP progress pre-selected; New Admission -&gt; H&amp;P; Consult -&gt; Consult note; Discharge summary is never the pre-selected template; the template override does not change the badge; Consult survives the reload and shows on the list</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>UAT TC-06 Expected Result + TFA-92584 AC 1, 3, 6. oracle.mjs per checkpoint; native selects list every option even when closed, so the checks are on which option is [selected] (calibrated in TC-21 S05). Discharge checks belong to T2 (not gated: UAT TC-06 + TFA-92584 AC 6). …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U61；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S01 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-06.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：PW · Playwright 脚本 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-06 Admission Status Toggle · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-06/S01</p><p><b>Hospital walk: add-form default, list badge, three states by hand, pre-selection per state, override, reload</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92584 Admission Status Toggle (ready for qa); TFA-92599 Hospital vs. Nursing-Home Context Switch (in progress)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U61.verdict.json</code>), unit U61 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 217 s, $0.66.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U61 (#51, rest, ui-only) — Badge walk with template pre-selection. Same legacy seed, same controls; S01 works only the Hospital patient and S02 only the resident, so neither touches the other's chart. Runs together with TC-06/S02.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #61, U61; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — UAT TC-06 main flow both modes: add form toggle (default Follow-up), template preselected per badge, hand override, reload, list badge</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-06 Admission Status Toggle","S01 Hospital walk: add-form default, list badge, three states by hand, pre-selection per state, overrid…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"a7fd377cf2ddd9e6db521e5c8835831f","originalFileName":"3d914caa-e38b-439f-b90e-a5b6813db84b-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":4242,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"96f7022760164c900743c573d985b247","originalFileName":"92178adf-1f26-4beb-92e4-c5d33108ce05-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68343},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"f31d43a7033a36a25f2001f5609b73b5","originalFileName":"ae11ec9a-c64e-49bc-b078-db58213257ed-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2432},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"d2fabb09250869145a551c1689225b71","originalFileName":"1d252eaf-808c-4613-8822-22928d35133b-attac